# KQL map charts (`kind = map` on a piechart or scatterchart) are not supported yet.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render scatterchart with (kind = map)
---- expected
error[DS5006]: map charts are not supported yet
  --> query:2:29
  |
2 | | render scatterchart with (kind = map)
  |                             ^^^^ `kind = map` asks for a KQL map chart
